n_note":"035裴憲與荀綽同陷石氏，後又事季龍，正本段同列文士組合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen-cuiyue:p004:m0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"暢","kind":"person","person_id":"258_ae3_26e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"與019評論楊準後嗣的晉人傅暢首選同人：同晉士文學記述圈、無已見反證，但舊源未具字籍；並非已由共同父祖證同，保可撤回資格。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen-cuiyue","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-ws1775345-luchen-cuiyue"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008","text":"世語曰欽字子若珽字子笏欽泰始中為尚書僕射領選咸寧四年卒追贈衛將軍開府虞預晉書曰欽少居名位不顧財利清虚淡薄勤修禮典同郡張華家單少孤不為鄉邑所知惟欽貴異焉欽子浮字子雲晉諸公贊曰張華博識多聞無物不知浮高朗經博有美於華起家太子舍人病疽截手遂廢朝廷器重之就家以為國子博士遷祭酒永平中為祕書監珽及子皓志並至尚書志子諶字子諒溫嶠表稱諶清飭有文思諶别傳曰諶善著文章洛陽傾覆北投劉琨琨以為司空從事中郎琨敗諶歸段末波元帝之初累召為散騎中書侍郎不得南赴永和六年卒於胡胡中子孫過江妖賊帥盧循諶之曾孫","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:w0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"世語","kind":"work","person_id":null,"status":"source_explicit","work_id":"w-shiyu-sgz027-reference"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:m0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"子若","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"珽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"子笏","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:m0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"虞預","kind":"person","person_id":"mhe_05y_s6w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p008:w0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"晉書","kind":"work","person_id":null,"status":"s